    "next_picture": 113
  },
  {
    "id": 113,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/TeachingManual/Raw/Icon/S1_Activity_HuoMa3.S1_Activity_HuoMa3'",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 4,
    "background_music": "2006",
    "next_picture": 114
  },
  {
    "id": 114,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/TeachingManual/Raw/Icon/S1_Activity_HuoMa4.S1_Activity_HuoMa4'",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 5,
    "background_music": "2006"
  },
  {
    "id": 201,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/TeachingManual/Raw/Icon/s2_task_01.s2_task_01'",
    "text": "好厉害的马戏表演！",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 5,
    "background_music": "100",
    "next_picture": 202
  },
  {
    "id": 202,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/TeachingManual/Raw/Icon/s2_task_02.s2_task_02'",
    "text": "等我长大了，我也要变成超级厉害的魔法师！",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 5,
    "next_picture": 203
  },
  {
    "id": 203,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/TeachingManual/Raw/Icon/s2_task_03.s2_task_03'",
    "text": "你好，我叫希洛。很高兴认识你！既然你的脚下的咕噜老是转个不停，我那就叫你小轱辘好了。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 4,
    "next_picture": 204
  },
  {
    "id": 204,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/TeachingManual/Raw/Icon/s2_task_04.s2_task_04'",
    "text": "让人心跳加速的大炮飞人！没想到你也喜欢这个节目！",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 4,
    "next_picture": 205
  },
  {
    "id": 205,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/TeachingManual/Raw/Icon/s2_task_05.s2_task_05'",
    "text": "加油，小轱辘，就快到终点了！你是最厉害的！",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 4,
    "next_picture": 206
  },
  {
    "id": 206,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/TeachingManual/Raw/Icon/s2_task_06.s2_task_06'",
    "text": "哈哈！我们是最厉害的搭档！总有一天，我们也会创造出整个大陆最棒的马戏团。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 5,
    "next_picture": 207
  },
  {
    "id": 207,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/TeachingManual/Raw/Icon/s2_task_07.s2_task_07'",
    "text": "小轱辘，等我学会最厉害的魔法，就回来找你！",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 5,
    "background_music": "104"
  },
  {
    "id": 1001,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/quanfarr1.quanfarr1'",
    "text": "许多年前，法尔是一只商店街的小狗。它和它的主人弗雷姆，相识于附近终日忙碌的码头。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 15,
    "background_music": "51",
    "next_picture": 1002
  },
  {
    "id": 1002,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/quanfarr2.quanfarr2'",
    "text": "作为辛苦的码头小子，每天下班，弗雷姆都能等到可爱的法尔，和它一起玩耍。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 7,
    "next_picture": 1003
  },
  {
    "id": 1003,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/quanfarr3.quanfarr3'",
    "text": "玩到累了，一洛一犬便会躺倒在岸边。弗雷姆时常看着远山，轻轻告诉法尔外面的世界。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 7,
    "next_picture": 1004
  },
  {
    "id": 1004,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/quanfarr4.quanfarr4'",
    "text": "渐渐地，法尔将弗雷姆视作了最亲密的主人；在弗雷姆眼中，法尔亦是世界上最可爱的小狗。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 1,
    "auto_play_time": 9,
    "next_picture": 1005
  },
  {
    "id": 1005,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/quanfarr5.quanfarr5'",
    "text": "直到有一天，弗雷姆像往常一样出海，却再也没有回来。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 1,
    "auto_play_time": 14,
    "next_picture": 1006
  },
  {
    "id": 1006,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/quanfarr6.quanfarr6'",
    "text": "得知真相的镇民告诉了法尔噩耗，可它却并不相信。于是它从一个个天黑，等到一个个天亮。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 1,
    "auto_play_time": 17,
    "next_picture": 1007
  },
  {
    "id": 1007,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/quanfarr7.quanfarr7'",
    "text": "往日码头逐渐废弃，水手也不再往来。只有法尔固执地守在月牙湖畔，遥遥无期地等待主人的归来。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 1,
    "auto_play_time": 16,
    "next_picture": 1008
  },
  {
    "id": 1008,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/quanfarr8.quanfarr8'",
    "text": "后来，附近的洛克们决定为弗雷姆和法尔修建一座纪念碑。他们以此铭记法尔的衷心守候，还有，被这个故事感动的心……",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 26
  },
  {
    "id": 1011,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/niaoatlan1.niaoatlan1'",
    "text": "百年前，当信仰者们纷纷涌入这座台地的时刻。作为台地原住民的阿特岚，尚未做好接纳他们的准备。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 12,
    "background_music": "44",
    "next_picture": 1012
  },
  {
    "id": 1012,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/niaoatlan2.niaoatlan2'",
    "text": "一直以来，信仰者们想要取悦这位冷面的霜翼领主。但却纷纷被阿特岚率性的行径，无言拒绝。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1013
  },
  {
    "id": 1013,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/niaoatlan3.niaoatlan3'",
    "text": "直到，风雪呼啸扑向村落的那天……阿特岚振翅而起，奋力将砸向人们的积雪扫入山崖之下。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 1,
    "auto_play_time": 17,
    "next_picture": 1014
  },
  {
    "id": 1014,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/niaoatlan4.niaoatlan4'",
    "text": "信仰者们将那搏击风雪的强韧身姿，视作一场充满力量的「神舞」。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 14,
    "next_picture": 1015
  },
  {
    "id": 1015,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/niaoatlan5.niaoatlan5'",
    "text": "人们的感激与崇拜，化作了村落的「星霜花塔」。这是信仰者们，对阿特岚阁下无私守护的敬意。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 18,
    "next_picture": 1016
  },
  {
    "id": 1016,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/niaoatlan6.niaoatlan6'",
    "text": "而后，一场舞姿笨拙的舞会，成为了台地新的仪式。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 12,
    "next_picture": 1017
  },
  {
    "id": 1017,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/niaoatlan7.niaoatlan7'",
    "text": "当误会成为传说，当事鸟阿特岚却哭笑不得——它不过做了举爪之劳而已。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 20,
    "next_picture": 1018
  },
  {
    "id": 1018,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/niaoatlan8.niaoatlan8'",
    "text": "但它似乎也明白了洛克的可爱之处。这是即便性格如阿特岚这般冰冷，也能感受到的善良与温暖。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 14
  },
  {
    "id": 1021,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/maofumorgan1.maofumorgan1'",
    "text": "几年前，风眠省流传着一个离奇的传闻，有一个无处不在的黑影在暗中观察着每一个洛克……",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 15,
    "background_music": "54",
    "next_picture": 1022
  },
  {
    "id": 1022,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/maofumorgan2.maofumorgan2'",
    "text": "那道黑影从不伤人，像风一样掠过村落，又总在被察觉的瞬间迅速离开。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 12,
    "next_picture": 1023
  },
  {
    "id": 1023,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/maofumorgan3.maofumorgan3'",
    "text": "黑影像是在寻找什么，渐渐地，它不再出现在城镇里。传言也随着时光淡去，成了镇民们饭后的旧话。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 1,
    "auto_play_time": 12,
    "next_picture": 1024
  },
  {
    "id": 1024,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/maofumorgan4.maofumorgan4'",
    "text": "人们不知道的是，黑影已潜入峡谷最深处的秘地之中。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1025
  },
  {
    "id": 1025,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/maofumorgan5.maofumorgan5'",
    "text": "而这名神秘的黑影，则是昔日鼎鼎大名的密探——芙摩甘。在峡谷深处，她找到了苦寻已久的遗物。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 12,
    "next_picture": 1026
  },
  {
    "id": 1026,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/maofumorgan6.maofumorgan6'",
    "text": "如今，镇子里依旧对黑影的去处众说纷纭。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1027
  },
  {
    "id": 1027,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/maofumorgan7.maofumorgan7'",
    "text": "而可爱的芙摩甘，此时正安然守护着好友的宝物。它坚信着，假以时日，那个家伙会再次降临。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11
  },
  {
    "id": 1031,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/xuearya1.xuearya1'",
    "text": "在很小的时候，艾莉亚便感觉到自己的与众不同。比起风雪中的其他精灵，它显然更加聪明、更富有情感。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 15,
    "background_music": "86",
    "next_picture": 1032
  },
  {
    "id": 1032,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/xuearya2.xuearya2'",
    "text": "艾莉亚喜欢耍弄独特的玩偶戏法。在戏法变幻之间，它希望能给大家带去欢乐。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 15,
    "next_picture": 1033
  },
  {
    "id": 1033,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/xuearya3.xuearya3'",
    "text": "但忙碌的旅人们，却好像从未理解过它的好意。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 1,
    "auto_play_time": 7,
    "next_picture": 1034
  },
  {
    "id": 1034,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/xuearya4.xuearya4'",
    "text": "当友善不被理解，小小的孤单，也萦绕着艾莉亚。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 8,
    "next_picture": 1035
  },
  {
    "id": 1035,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/xuearya5.xuearya5'",
    "text": "好在，一阵寒风，引来了一群懵懂的学院孩子们。「哇啊！」，他们被突然出现的身影吓了一跳。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 13,
    "background_music": "70",
    "next_picture": 1036
  },
  {
    "id": 1036,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/xuearya6.xuearya6'",
    "text": "艾莉亚再一次鼓起勇气，轻轻施动了奇异的魔法。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 14,
    "next_picture": 1037
  },
  {
    "id": 1037,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/xuearya7.xuearya7'",
    "text": "而这一次，孩子们的眼睛却亮了起来。「太棒啦！」「这是你的能力吧！」",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 13,
    "next_picture": 1038
  },
  {
    "id": 1038,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/xuearya8.xuearya8'",
    "text": "篝火映衬着欢笑，艾莉亚的戏法，终于收获了懂得欣赏的观众。而艾莉亚，也拥有了新的朋友。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 15
  },
  {
    "id": 1041,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/stoneblack1.stoneblack1'",
    "text": "在孩子们的眼中，布莱克先生不仅是一块石头，还是信仰者村落坚实的保护者。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 17,
    "background_music": "58",
    "next_picture": 1042
  },
  {
    "id": 1042,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/stoneblack2.stoneblack2'",
    "text": "无论时光如何轮转，布莱克始终忠诚地守护着神山的草木与晨昏。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 13,
    "next_picture": 1043
  },
  {
    "id": 1043,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/stoneblack3.stoneblack3'",
    "text": "「神山不容任何人的破坏」，布莱克谨记着记忆石爷爷的忠告。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 14,
    "next_picture": 1044
  },
  {
    "id": 1044,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/stoneblack4.stoneblack4'",
    "text": "它高举双拳，将心怀不轨的闯入者一次次打出神山的地界。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 17,
    "next_picture": 1045
  },
  {
    "id": 1045,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/stoneblack5.stoneblack5'",
    "text": "那些在布莱克手中吃瘪的家伙们散布谣言，将它歪曲成了凶猛恶兽，但关于这一切，布莱克并不在乎。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 8,
    "next_picture": 1046
  },
  {
    "id": 1046,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/stoneblack6.stoneblack6'",
    "text": "也许，布莱克先生永远无法表露自己的感受，但它总在以自己的方式保护着大家。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 9,
    "next_picture": 1047
  },
  {
    "id": 1047,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/stoneblack7.stoneblack7'",
    "text": "它岩石般坚韧的心中，有的只是全力守护大家与神山的火焰。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11
  },
  {
    "id": 1071,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/guodoct1.guodoct1'",
    "text": "蹦蹦家族以毒闻名，可多特偏要化毒为药，它执针走遍荒野，只为疗愈众生。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "background_music": "23",
    "next_picture": 1072
  },
  {
    "id": 1072,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/guodoct2.guodoct2'",
    "text": "面对广袤的世界，多特十分渴望发挥自己的才能。然而，它的初次出诊，却进行得并不顺利。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1073
  },
  {
    "id": 1073,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/guodoct3.guodoct3'",
    "text": "慌乱之中，一位年迈的洛克不慎摔倒。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 5,
    "next_picture": 1074
  },
  {
    "id": 1074,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/guodoct4.guodoct4'",
    "text": "来不及顾及什么，面对痛苦的老人，多特本能地为老人进行了治疗。治疗结束后，多特便默默离开了。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 16,
    "next_picture": 1075
  },
  {
    "id": 1075,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/guodoct5.guodoct5'",
    "text": "语言不通的医生又该如何治病呢？多特陷入了短暂的低落之中。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1076
  },
  {
    "id": 1076,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/guodoct6.guodoct6'",
    "text": "但很快，多特神奇善良的行径，就被附近的洛克们所传颂。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1077
  },
  {
    "id": 1077,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/guodoct7.guodoct7'",
    "text": "在老人善意的回馈下，它再也不需要漫游山野了。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1078
  },
  {
    "id": 1078,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/guodoct8.guodoct8'",
    "text": "而是成为了晨曦山的守望者，大家逐渐信赖的——「多特医生」。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11
  },
  {
    "id": 1101,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/misansan1.misansan1'",
    "text": "三月三日的清晨，一个偷吃麦子的「黄色团子」不小心在第三垄麦垛上睡着了。老麦克就是这样捡到三三的。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 20,
    "background_music": "25",
    "next_picture": 1102
  },
  {
    "id": 1102,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/misansan2.misansan2'",
    "text": "三三最爱用尖尖牙戳破青青麦粒的瞬间。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 8,
    "next_picture": 1103
  },
  {
    "id": 1103,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/misansan3.misansan3'",
    "text": "嫩味浸透口腔，甘甜中带着点青涩。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 7,
    "next_picture": 1104
  },
  {
    "id": 1104,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/misansan4.misansan4'",
    "text": "三三常把麦穗分给小洛克们，孩子们咯咯笑着，和它一起躲开大人们假装生气的吆喝。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1105
  },
  {
    "id": 1105,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/misansan5.misansan5'",
    "text": "然而无论如何，三三都是甜水镇最受欢迎的宠儿。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 14,
    "next_picture": 1106
  },
  {
    "id": 1106,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/misansan6.misansan6'",
    "text": "它会用爪子灵巧地割断麦秆，卷起一个又一个麦垛。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 14,
    "next_picture": 1107
  },
  {
    "id": 1107,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/misansan7.misansan7'",
    "text": "没有洛克忍心责怪一个帮老麦克收完十亩地后、躺在麦堆上打嗝的大毛球。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 13,
    "next_picture": 1108
  },
  {
    "id": 1108,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/misansan8.misansan8'",
    "text": "镇民的爱、孩子们的梦想，化成了神奇的力量，存储进三三圆鼓鼓的肚子。三三就是这样，成了第一只会飞的气球猫。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 24
  },
  {
    "id": 1131,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/langcross1.langcross1'",
    "text": "「体温正常，恢复得很好」，她温柔的声音安抚着克洛斯。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 13,
    "background_music": "56",
    "next_picture": 1132
  },
  {
    "id": 1132,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/langcross2.langcross2'",
    "text": "记忆始于疼痛。克洛斯曾嘶吼，挣扎，在黑暗中被噩梦吞噬。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1133
  },
  {
    "id": 1133,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/langcross3.langcross3'",
    "text": "而后，她出现了。克洛斯本能地充满警惕。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1134
  },
  {
    "id": 1134,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/langcross4.langcross4'",
    "text": "它不懂她想做什么，只觉得这苦涩的气味，像是又一场痛苦的预兆。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1135
  },
  {
    "id": 1135,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/langcross5.langcross5'",
    "text": "直到某次失控后，克洛斯再次醒来，却看见她在为它治疗。那些被克洛斯视作威胁的药液，原来是她无声的守护与疗愈。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1136
  },
  {
    "id": 1136,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/langcross6.langcross6'",
    "text": "那之后，克洛斯不再抗拒，它开始尝试喝药，尝试接受她的照料，尝试回应她的关切。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 12,
    "next_picture": 1137
  },
  {
    "id": 1137,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/langcross7.langcross7'",
    "text": "信任在每日的坚持中生根发芽，克洛斯越来越期待她的到来。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1138
  },
  {
    "id": 1138,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/langcross8.langcross8'",
    "text": "如今，它常偎在她身旁，在这沼泽之上，它重新拥有了与她一起的未来。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 14
  },
  {
    "id": 1141,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/shubranso1.shubranso1'",
    "text": "在污染区边缘，界碑般的布兰索挺立如山，守护着身后残存的绿意。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 10,
    "background_music": "64",
    "next_picture": 1142
  },
  {
    "id": 1142,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/shubranso2.shubranso2'",
    "text": "数年前，它循着牧场的气息，从古怪的恶水林地，来到了水草丰茂的净土。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 9,
    "next_picture": 1143
  },
  {
    "id": 1143,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/shubranso3.shubranso3'",
    "text": "但它怪异的模样吓到了小精灵们，在寂静的原野上，唯有布兰索形单影只。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 9,
    "next_picture": 1144
  },
  {
    "id": 1144,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/shubranso4.shubranso4'",
    "text": "口渴的布兰索奔波寻觅，最终累倒在唯一有水的地方——污水泊。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 9,
    "next_picture": 1145
  },
  {
    "id": 1145,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/shubranso5.shubranso5'",
    "text": "当它再次醒来时，它惊讶地发现——在那倒下的地方，污水泊竟重新焕发了生机。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1146
  },
  {
    "id": 1146,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/shubranso6.shubranso6'",
    "text": "于是它驻守在这里，用身躯沉默地抵挡着恶水的侵蚀。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 10,
    "next_picture": 1147
  },
  {
    "id": 1147,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/shubranso7.shubranso7'",
    "text": "如今，小精灵们不再惧怕布兰索。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 11,
    "next_picture": 1148
  },
  {
    "id": 1148,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/Taskpetleader/shubranso8.shubranso8'",
    "text": "它们知道，在怪异的身躯里，是一颗善良的心。",
    "mask_effect_type": 1,
    "picture_switch_type": 2,
    "auto_play_time": 16
  },
  {
    "id": 2001,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/NewTask/lingfengzhen.lingfengzhen'",
    "text": "它们，聆听风的消息。风起时，它们不知疲倦地，围绕轴心舞蹈。风止时，它们静默地等待，坐看日升月落。",
    "auto_play_time": 10,
    "background_music": "59",
    "next_picture": 2002
  },
  {
    "id": 2002,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/NewTask/lingfengzhen.lingfengzhen'",
    "text": "你总说，那是在向天空轻轻招手。那就，去和它们打个招呼吧——在长满青苔的棚顶下，抬头便可看见它们的手掌。",
    "auto_play_time": 10,
    "next_picture": 2003
  },
  {
    "id": 2003,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/NewTask/lingfengzhen.lingfengzhen'",
    "text": "当你找不到方向的时候，就看看远方，也许风会带你去向注定的目的地。",
    "auto_play_time": 10
  },
  {
    "id": 2006,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/NewTask/xueshan.xueshan'",
    "text": "那里有着最纯净的色彩，是比云彩还冷的地方。",
    "auto_play_time": 10,
    "background_music": "85",
    "next_picture": 2007
  },
  {
    "id": 2007,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/NewTask/xueshan.xueshan'",
    "text": "在所有白色中间，在洞穴之中，闪闪发光的花，在等着你的到来。",
    "auto_play_time": 10,
    "next_picture": 2008
  },
  {
    "id": 2008,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/NewTask/xueshan.xueshan'",
    "text": "当你找不到方向的时候，就看看远方，也许那份凉意会带你去向注定的目的地。",
    "auto_play_time": 10
  },
  {
    "id": 2010,
    "picture": "Texture2D'/Game/NewRoco/Modules/System/Task/Raw/NewTask/pubu.pubu'",
    "text": "是上天落下的甘霖，由高到低奔走喧闹。",
    "auto_play_time": 10,
    "background_music": "67",
    "next_picture": 2011
  },
  {
    "id": 2011,
